  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASEAN Climate Change an Energy Project (ACCEPT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims to improve the coherence of ASEAN energy policy and contribute to making ASEAN&#x2019;s energy policy more climate friendly. This is done thorough 1) raising the awareness about the implications of energy-related climate policy and sustainable development goals, 2) strengthen ASEAN Center for Energy as an institution and 3) inform the public about energy and climate policy.</narrative>
  </description>
